29:["$","p","Funding labels also need context. The Hungarian government's Stipendium Hungaricum covers tuition and offers an allowance and accommodation support, but its official site warns the contribution may not meet full living costs. A careful comparison records which costs remain the applicant's responsibility.",{"children":"Funding labels also need context. The Hungarian government's Stipendium Hungaricum covers tuition and offers an allowance and accommodation support, but its official site warns the contribution may not meet full living costs. A careful comparison records which costs remain the applicant's responsibility."}]
2a:["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Bachelor's: school nomination and undergraduate eligibility",{"children":"Bachelor's: school nomination and undergraduate eligibility"}],["$","li","Master's: course choice and admission sequence",{"children":"Master's: course choice and admission sequence"}],["$","li","PhD: supervisor, research scope and duration",{"children":"PhD: supervisor, research scope and duration"}],["$","li","All levels: net monthly budget after mandatory fees",{"children":"All levels: net monthly budget after mandatory fees"}]]}]
2b:["$","section","Build a one-page funding comparison",{"id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build a one-page funding comparison"}],[["$","p","For each shortlisted scholarship, enter the official programme, citizenship rule, degree level, application deadline, tuition support, stipend, housing, insurance, travel and conditions for renewal. Mark a benefit as 'not confirmed' when the current call is silent rather than filling it in from another year's announcement.",{"children":"For each shortlisted scholarship, enter the official programme, citizenship rule, degree level, application deadline, tuition support, stipend, housing, insurance, travel and conditions for renewal. Mark a benefit as 'not confirmed' when the current call is silent rather than filling it in from another year's announcement."}],["$","p","A candidate who needs full support for dependants or upfront visa and relocation expenses should calculate that separately; a scholarship called fully funded might still leave a large personal bill.",{"children":"A candidate who needs full support for dependants or upfront visa and relocation expenses should calculate that separately; a scholarship called fully funded might still leave a large personal bill."}]],"$undefined"]}]
